0..77 Comment "// Many models in scope (#2395): sixteen models of `Count`, each at a carrier"
78..157 Comment "// of its own, and one body calling `advanced` once at each carrier. Every call"
158..232 Comment "// leaves its model implicit out, so the checker tries each of the sixteen"
233..309 Comment "// candidates at each of the sixteen slots, against one solver store holding"
310..380 Comment "// all of their holes: the hotpath series\' `many candidates` workload."
